    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Current PUC Certificate</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Pollution Under Control (PUC) stamp confirms that the motorcycle complies with emission standards. A valid PUC is mandatory for any vehicle that will travel on public roads.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Valid Insurance Certificate</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">This document shows that the bike is covered under a third‑party policy. The certificate must display the policy number, coverage limits, and the period of validity.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA‑Approved Consignment Bilty</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Indian Bureau of Shipping (IBA) issues a consignment bilty that acts as a contract of carriage. It includes details such as the consignor, consignee, cargo description, and agreed freight charges.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>In addition to these core documents, it is highly advisable to obtain a <strong>100% declared‑value marine transit insurance</strong> policy. This type of coverage ensures that the full market value of the motorcycle is protected against loss, damage, or theft during the entire transit journey, whether by road, rail, or sea.</p>
<p>The insurer will pay out the declared value directly to the owner or the carrier, thereby eliminating the need for costly proof of loss procedures. Marine transit insurance is especially critical for high‑value bikes or when the vehicle is being shipped across state borders or overseas.</p>

<p>By assembling the self‑attested RC, current PUC, valid insurance certificate, and an IBA‑approved consignment bilty, and by reinforcing the shipment with a 100% declared‑value marine transit policy, owners can move their motorcycles with confidence, knowing that every legal and financial safeguard has been meticulously addressed.</p></div>
